WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:04.036
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:06.755
What do they see?

3
00:00:06.756 --> 00:00:21.635
They see a theater.

4
00:00:21.636 --> 00:00:31.631
The blobs find costumes.

5
00:00:31.632 --> 00:00:56.582
They try on masks.

6
00:00:56.583 --> 00:01:15.246
They try on wigs.

7
00:01:15.247 --> 00:01:30.122
They try on wings.

8
00:01:30.123 --> 00:01:50.871
They try on makeup.

9
00:01:50.872 --> 00:02:18.210
They try on shoes.

10
00:02:18.211 --> 00:02:21.298
The blobs go on the stage.

11
00:02:21.299 --> 00:02:25.952
The curtain is going up.

12
00:02:25.953 --> 00:02:32.119
Wow! The blobs are in a show!

13
00:02:32.120 --> 00:02:34.524
Silly blobs!

14
00:02:34.525 --> 00:02:38.899
Good-bye!

